{"a":[17,17],"h":"<p>17.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 88.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 33.7 40.4 40.4 56.2 56.2 65.2 65.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 56.2 72.0\" y=\"26.3 21.1 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sonra denilecektir: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"231\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 230.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 42.0 51.0 63.0 63.0 78.7 78.7 85.6 85.6 101.3 101.3 110.3 110.3 117.0 117.0 123.7 123.7 144.0 157.6 157.6 166.6 166.6 174.0 189.7 196.6 205.6 205.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 51.0 166.6 196.6 214.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu işte o sizin yalan, masal diye tekzîb edip durduğunuz. 18.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 56.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 21.7 28.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.7 28.4 39.7\" y=\"21.1 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - bu KELLÂ, ta yukarıdaki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"163\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 163.2 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 11.2 18.0 18.0 30.7 30.7 37.4 37.4 45.0 60.7 77.2 84.0 90.7 90.7 111.0 111.0 121.4 121.4 128.2 137.2 137.2 142.4 149.2\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"18.0 60.7 84.0 111.0 142.4 149.2\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » deki kellâya nazır olarak tatfîf ve tekzîbden bir daha zecr ile birr-ü hayra sevk etmek üzere kıyam gününün diğer bir yüzünü ıhtardır. </p>"}